#, fuzzy, python-format
msgid "“%(tag)s” is not a language code. One looks like en-GB, fr-FR or pt-BR."
msgstr "Ní cód teanga é “%(tag)s”. Tá cuma en-GB, fr-FR nó pt-BR ar cheann."

#: src/postulo/plugins/identifiers/patterns.py
#, fuzzy
msgid "“(?” begins a group this language does not have: nothing looks ahead or behind, and no group has a name."
msgstr "Tosaíonn “(?” grúpa nach bhfuil sa teanga seo: ní fhéachann aon rud chun tosaigh ná ar gcúl, agus níl ainm ar aon ghrúpa."

#: src/postulo/plugins/identifiers/patterns.py
#, fuzzy
msgid "“*” and “+” repeat without a limit, and a pattern has to say how many times at the most: write {0,20} or {1,20}."
msgstr "Athdhéanann “*” agus “+” gan teorainn, agus caithfidh patrún a rá cé mhéad uair ar a mhéad: scríobh {0,20} nó {1,20}."

#: src/postulo/plugins/identifiers/patterns.py
#, fuzzy
msgid "“[^]” leaves nothing out, so it means any character, and that is not part of this language. Write a class such as [^ ] for any character but a space."
msgstr "Fágann “[^]” aon rud ar lár, mar sin ciallaíonn sé aon charachtar, agus níl sin mar chuid den teanga seo. Scríobh aicme mar [^ ] le haghaidh aon charachtar ach spás."

#: src/postulo/plugins/identifiers/patterns.py
#, fuzzy, python-format
msgid "“\\%(letter)s” is not part of this language. The classes with a name are \\d, a digit, and \\w, a letter, a digit or an underscore; a backslash before a punctuation mark stands for the mark itself."
msgstr "Níl “\\%(letter)s” mar chuid den teanga seo. Is iad na haicmí ainmnithe \\d, digit, agus \\w, litir, digit nó béim íochtair; seasann cúlslais roimh chomhartha poncaíochta don chomhartha féin."

#: src/postulo/plugins/identifiers/patterns.py
#, fuzzy
msgid "“^” and “$” are allowed only at the two ends of a pattern, where they change nothing: a pattern always describes the whole value."
msgstr "Ní cheadaítear “^” agus “$” ach ag dhá cheann patrúin, áit nach n-athraíonn siad aon rud: déanann patrún cur síos ar an luach iomlán i gcónaí."

#: src/postulo/plugins/identifiers/custom.py
#, fuzzy
msgid "“checksum” names one of the two Postulo knows: iso7064-mod11-2, which an ORCID ends in, or iso7064-mod97-10, which a legal-entity identifier ends in."
msgstr "Ainmníonn “checksum” ceann den dá cheann a bhfuil aithne ag Postulo orthu: iso7064-mod11-2, a chríochnaíonn ORCID leis, nó iso7064-mod97-10, a chríochnaíonn aitheantóir eintitis dhlíthiúil leis."

#: src/postulo/plugins/identifiers/custom.py
