msgstr "Cuireann “lower” an méid a clóscríobhadh ina litreacha beaga sula n-iarrtar an patrún, agus ní ghlacann an patrún seo le haon rud scríofa i litreacha beaga: ní ghlacfadh an scéim le luach ar bith. Scríobh an patrún i litreacha beaga, nó bain “lower” amach."

#: src/postulo/plugins/identifiers/custom.py
#, fuzzy
msgid "“pattern” is text in double quotes."
msgstr "Is téacs idir comharthaí athfhriotail dúbailte é “pattern”."

#: src/postulo/plugins/identifiers/custom.py
#, fuzzy
msgid "“subjects” lists what the scheme identifies: [\"person\"], [\"company\"] or [\"person\", \"company\"]."
msgstr "Liostaíonn “subjects” cad a aithníonn an scéim: [\"person\"], [\"company\"] nó [\"person\", \"company\"]."

#: src/postulo/plugins/identifiers/custom.py
#, fuzzy
msgid "“upper” and “lower” cannot both be true."
msgstr "Ní féidir “upper” agus “lower” a bheith true araon."

#: src/postulo/plugins/identifiers/custom.py
#, fuzzy
msgid "“upper” puts what was typed into capitals before the pattern is asked, and this pattern takes nothing written in capitals: the scheme would accept no value at all. Write the pattern in capitals, or take “upper” out."
msgstr "Cuireann “upper” an méid a clóscríobhadh ina cheannlitreacha sula n-iarrtar an patrún, agus ní ghlacann an patrún seo le haon rud scríofa i gceannlitreacha: ní ghlacfadh an scéim le luach ar bith. Scríobh an patrún i gceannlitreacha, nó bain “upper” amach."
